{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imagine a world controlled by... Capitalistic Beans...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> A World where all of your businesses thrive, where there is a ton of things to play with and a ton of satisfaction from everything you do. Forget about the boredom.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Welcome to Capitaland.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capitaland is a Game where You  buy Properties, Upgrade them and do Simple Jobs to collect Money from them. The game has a lot of fun mechanics like Fishing, Collecting Mushrooms, Helping the Neighbors to get Reputation, Searching for Collectibles or Random Boosts, Upgrading your Businesses to get more money, doing unique Tasks for each Property, Buying or Collecting Permanent Boosts for Properties, Gambling at the Casino or buying Lootboxes and a lot more. No Boredom and Pure Fun is Guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you just want to look at the money stacking up, or creating new strategies to get to the top as fast as possible, It's all there for you! You can focus on the main goal or explore the city and it's nature full of interesting stuff and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/extras/c4c9f77f18c4f4d75e31dd89f889df43.poster.avif?t=1768506408\" aria-label=\"Quick Gameplay\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/extras/c4c9f77f18c4f4d75e31dd89f889df43.webm?t=1768506408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/extras/c4c9f77f18c4f4d75e31dd89f889df43.mp4?t=1768506408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the gameplay you will have a lot of different places to discover like the Casino where you could risk the money to be richer, Buy apartments where you could change their appearance or get benefits like respawnable lootboxes, Car Salloon where you could buy yourself a faster way of transport, A lot of special places around the map to do parkour and much more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006110?t=1768506408","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/d8aaf18dd6a4344fa5445a5647079716701ee8fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768506408","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/291615377ef211eea92cfcd01ed5d83b1dae24c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768506408","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/291615377ef211eea92cfcd01ed5d83b1dae24c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768506408","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imagine a world controlled by... Capitalistic Beans...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> A World where all of your businesses thrive, where there is a ton of things to play with and a ton of satisfaction from everything you do. Forget about the boredom.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Welcome to Capitaland.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capitaland is a Game where You  buy Properties, Upgrade them and do Simple Jobs to collect Money from them. The game has a lot of fun mechanics like Fishing, Collecting Mushrooms, Helping the Neighbors to get Reputation, Searching for Collectibles or Random Boosts, Upgrading your Businesses to get more money, doing unique Tasks for each Property, Buying or Collecting Permanent Boosts for Properties, Gambling at the Casino or buying Lootboxes and a lot more. No Boredom and Pure Fun is Guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you just want to look at the money stacking up, or creating new strategies to get to the top as fast as possible, It's all there for you! You can focus on the main goal or explore the city and it's nature full of interesting stuff and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/extras/c4c9f77f18c4f4d75e31dd89f889df43.poster.avif?t=1768506408\" aria-label=\"Quick Gameplay\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/extras/c4c9f77f18c4f4d75e31dd89f889df43.webm?t=1768506408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/extras/c4c9f77f18c4f4d75e31dd89f889df43.mp4?t=1768506408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the gameplay you will have a lot of different places to discover like the Casino where you could risk the money to be richer, Buy apartments where you could change their appearance or get benefits like respawnable lootboxes, Car Salloon where you could buy yourself a faster way of transport, A lot of special places around the map to do parkour and much more.</p>","developers":["ENRGTK"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006110/453e026103ef03851cf913fe3711c5c685fa66fc/header.j